---
import { ASSESSMENT_HREF, WHATSAPP_HREF } from '../../lib/home';
import ServiceIcon from '../services/ServiceIcon.astro';
---

<section class="consult-cta reveal" id="start" aria-labelledby="home-cta-heading">
  <div class="consult-cta__inner">
    <span class="consult-cta__icon" aria-hidden="true">
      <ServiceIcon name="chat" class="h-6 w-6" />
    </span>
    <div class="consult-cta__copy">
      <h2 id="home-cta-heading">Not sure what your next step should be?</h2>
      <p>
        That’s okay. Tell us what you’re planning, where you’re hoping to go, or what you’re trying to build. No
        pressure. No false promises. Just a clear conversation about your options — and a written scope before any paid
        work.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="company-band__ctas">
      <a class="consult-cta__btn" href={ASSESSMENT_HREF}>Start Assessment →</a>
      <a class="home-ghost" href={WHATSAPP_HREF} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Chat on WhatsApp</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
